Q: How to create dynamic drop down lists using combo boxes? VBA EXCEL A: <p>I managed to find a way of creating a 3 layer, dynamic combo box drop down list. It may not be pretty and there will be some inefficiencies in my code but I'm still learning this stuff.</p>
<p>Here's my code:</p>
<p>To populate layer 1 drop down list as drop down is clicked for first time.</p>
<pre class="lang-vb prettyprint-override"><code>Private Sub ComboBox1_DropButtonClick()

